CITI is pleased to host the June 2003 Bake-athon, June 2-6, 2003. The purpose 
of this event is to test the interoperability of specific parts of the NFSv4  
protocol, discuss the protocol specification and test ideas.

Anyone who has implemented parts of the NFS version 4 specification, or who 
has developed NFSv4 testing tools is invited to register.

To register, and for more information see 

http://www.citi.umich.edu/projects/nfsv4/citi_bakeoff/8th_nfsv4_bake-athon.html


